{
  "description": "Arena props & weapons for the Godot 4 1v1 Lone Wolf shooter. All values in meters, Godot axes (+Y up, -Z forward, +X right) = glTF axes. Blender (x,y,z) -> Godot (x, z, -y).",
  "conventions": {
    "weapons": "Origin = right-hand pistol-grip point (centre of the grip). Barrel points -Z (Godot forward), top +Y. Marker nodes: \"Muzzle\" = barrel tip; \"LeftHand\" = support-hand point (AR: centre of handguard just behind the hand-stop; SG: centre of the pump; pistol: on the grip, offset 1.2 cm to the left/1 cm down).",
    "props": "Origin at bottom centre (Y=0 is the ground). Front faces -Z (Blender +Y) where it matters: lamp arm, watchtower ladder, shield convex side, sandbag convex side, house front door. Container doors are at +X.",
    "uv": "UV0 = world-space box projection, 1 UV unit = 1 m (mountains: 1 UV unit = 10 m), for tileable textures by material name.",
    "shading": "Smooth shading with sharp edges > ~60 deg and weighted (face-area) custom normals; bevels applied."
  },
